{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Living Constellation","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/living-constellation.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/living-constellation.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Living Constellation","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":135,"temp":0,"max":135,"details":""},"ac":{"value":29,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":50}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":10,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"physical","value":10,"exceptions":["cold-iron"],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common"],"details":"can't speak any language"},"level":{"value":10},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>While the light of a star is often seen as a sign of hope, living constellations represent the exact opposite. Otherworldly and enigmatic, they live among the normal stars of the night sky. Their bodies are made up of sickly green stars with lines joining them like joints. They orbit the world erratically with unpredictable positioning, descending and taking on the forms of well-known constellations to garner the attention of those who look to the stars in the night.</p>\n<p>When mortals see them, living constellations attempt to lead those mortals into perilous situations in order to feed off of their fear. This effect becomes strongest in close proximity, and so living constellations leave their homes in outer space to feast on fear. Scholarly attempts to study living constellations have thus far resulted in failure, leaving the researchers befuddled or trembling with fear for weeks on end. The malignant aberrations welcome this, however, as more attention grants them a greater audience to manipulate for their fear.</p>\n<h2>Unspeakable Horror</h2>\n<p>Speculation abounds that living constellations are agents of the Great Old Ones sent to determine if a world is ripe for conquest. While the occasional living constellation may not be cause for great alarm, multitudes appearing in rapid succession can stir thoughts of the apocalypse in even the most composed individuals. True or not, these beliefs serve the living constellation's purpose by arousing more fear for it to consume.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 125/275/500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing), armor (light, medium), shield, perception item, skill items (Arcana, Deception, Intimidation, Nature, Occultism, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, chaotic, charisma, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (positive), evil, fire, good, light, mental, spells (Primal: guidance, guiding star, light, searing light), strength, sturdy, throwing, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Hunter Evans","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":5},"con":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":7}},"perception":{"details":"know fear (imprecise) 1, 000 feet","mod":19,"senses":[],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"arcana":{"base":19},"deception":{"base":19},"intimidation":{"base":22},"nature":{"base":19},"occultism":{"base":19},"stealth":{"base":22,"special":[{"label":"to Hide in the night sky among the stars","base":25,"predicate":["action:hide","terrain:night-sky"]}]}},"traits":{"value":["aberration","astral","evil","fire"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/living-constellation.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Consume Fear","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature becomes frightened within 30 feet of the living constellation.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The living constellation attempts to feed off of the fear of the target, forcing it to attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:29] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[2d12[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 3d12[mental]]] damage and becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 4d12[mental]]] damage and becomes slowed 1 for 1 round or as long as it is frightened, whichever is longer.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"z1fLOsmBvyLdhKsg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688843672913,"modifiedTime":1691261013303,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Frightful Presence","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>10 feet @Check[type:will|dc:26]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":10,"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"]}],"slug":"frightful-presence","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688843715712,"modifiedTime":1691713643844,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"V4KVurdcnifZ79dE"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Alter Form","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The variability of the cosmos allows the constellation to alter its form. It assumes one of the following stances.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Archer Stance</strong> The living constellation takes on a humanoid form, resembling the graceful shots of an archer. While in this stance, the only attacks the constellation can make are shooting star Strikes.</li>\n<li><strong>Crab Stance</strong> The living constellation flattens itself, growing the limbs of a crab. While in this stance, the living constellation gains a +2 status bonus to AC and the only attack the constellation can make are cosmic claw Strikes.</li>\n<li><strong>Scorpion Stance</strong> The living constellation contracts into the form of a large scorpion. While in this stance, the living constellation gains a +25-foot status bonus to its Speeds, and the only attack the constellation can make are astral stinger Strikes.</li>\n</ul>"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"alter-form","suboptions":[{"label":"Archer Stance","value":"archer"},{"label":"Crab Stance","value":"crab"},{"label":"Scorpion Stance","value":"scorpion"}],"toggleable":true,"value":true,"alwaysActive":true,"selection":"scorpion"},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":2,"die":"d12","modifier":11}},"attackModifier":23,"group":"brawling","key":"Strike","label":"Astral Stinger","predicate":["alter-form:scorpion"],"traits":["magical","reach"]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"astral-stinger-damage","damageType":"fire","category":"persistent","diceNumber":1,"dieSize":"d6"},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"all-speeds","value":25,"predicate":["alter-form:scorpion"]},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"fire","dice":2,"die":"d12","modifier":11}},"attackModifier":23,"range":{"increment":30},"key":"Strike","label":" Shooting Star","predicate":["alter-form:archer"],"traits":["magical","fire"]},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":2,"die":"d10","modifier":11}},"attackModifier":23,"key":"Strike","label":"  Cosmic Claw","predicate":["alter-form:crab"],"traits":["magical","agile"]},{"key":"Note","selector":"cosmic-claw-attack","text":"PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab","title":"PF2E.AttackEffectGrab","visibility":"owner"},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":2,"predicate":["alter-form:crab"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["stance"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"4IwbZBdOfr3ZefSG","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688843757339,"modifiedTime":1691130387479,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"grab","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.