 energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 fire damage. If the target is a fiend or undead, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<p>If the light passes through an area of magical darkness or targets a creature affected by magical darkness, <em>searing light</em> attempts to counteract the darkness. If you need to determine whether the light passes through an area of darkness, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double fire damage, as well as double good damage if a fiend or undead.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 2d6, and the good damage against fiends and undead increases by 2d6.</p>\n<p>[[/r ((@item.level*2)-1)d6[spirit]]]{Leveled Good Damage}</p>"},"rules":[{"damageType":"spirit","diceNumber":"(@spell.level*2)-1","dieSize":"d6","key":"DamageDice","predicate":[{"or":["target:trait:fiend","target:trait:undead"]}],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"slug":"searing-light","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","concentrate","fire","good","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"formula":"5d6","type":"fire","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"4YQP51QSFxeH6ECi","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":true,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688846426884,"modifiedTime":1688846426884,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.DyiD239dNS7RIxZE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"guKKRJGe83m1RxZ9"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/guiding-star.webp","name":"Guiding Star (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You call on the constellations of the night sky to guide a creature to the location where you Cast the Spell. Each time the target views the stars, it receives a mental nudge toward your chosen location, though it isn't compelled to follow. The target can recognize you as the source. If the creature goes to another planet or plane, the spell's effects are suppressed, but they resume if the creature returns.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"guiding-star","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","detection","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Secrets of Magic","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature you've met"},"range":{"value":"planetary"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"4YQP51QSFxeH6ECi","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688846433892,"modifiedTime":1688846453141,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.L10q1ng6U3sega9S","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"IO57ShEJEIWILhYk"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/guidance.webp","name":"Guidance","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You ask for divine guidance, granting the target a +1 status bonus to one attack roll, Perception check, saving throw, or skill check the target attempts before the duration ends. The target chooses which roll to use the bonus on before rolling. If the target uses the bonus, the spell ends. Either way, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3qHKBDF7lrHw8jFK]{Spell Effect: Guidance}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.3LyOkV25p7wA181H]{Effect: Guidance Immunity}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"guidance","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"until the start of your next turn","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"4YQP51QSFxeH6ECi"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688846440565,"modifiedTime":1688846440565,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.izcxFQFwf3woCnFs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"7iHt7RWZhS8gMrHO"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/light.webp","name":"Light","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The object glows, casting bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) like a torch. If you cast this spell again on a second object, the light spell on the first object ends.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The object sheds bright light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"light","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 object of 1 Bulk or less, either unattended or possessed by you or a willing ally"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until the next time you make your daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"4YQP51QSFxeH6ECi"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688846444379,"modifiedTime":1688846444379,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"bbDIF85EwKCLpoad"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"At-Will Spells","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AtWillSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"at-will-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688846479118,"modifiedTime":1688846479118,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.2YRDYVnC1eljaXKK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"LdkqFK1eFbxGtWo1"}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542896049,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"SLbbsYAk2UhngbC8","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":2500000}